  "zones": [
    {
      "scope": "damage",
      "id": "attack_power",
      "priority": -500,
      "scale": 1.0,
      "formula": "base_attack_power * (1 + attack_power_percent) + attack_power_flat",
      "requires": [
        "base_attack_power",
        "attack_power_percent",
        "attack_power_flat"
      ],
      "comment": "攻击力区：输出绝对点数（也是乘数）"
    },
    {
      "scope": "damage",
      "id": "multiplier",
      "priority": 500,
      "scale": 1.0,
      "formula": "damage_multiplier * multiplier_factor",
      "requires": [
        "damage_multiplier",
        "multiplier_factor"
      ],
      "comment": "伤害倍率区：独立乘数"
    },
    {
      "scope": "damage",
      "id": "critical",
      "priority": 750,
      "scale": 1.0,
      "formula": "is_critical ? max(1, 1 + (crit_damage + crit_damage_bonus + crit_bonus - 1) * (1 - crit_damage_taken_reduction)) : 1",
      "requires": [
        "is_critical",
        "crit_damage",
        "crit_damage_bonus",
        "crit_bonus",
        "crit_damage_taken_reduction"
      ],
      "comment": "暴击区：不暴击时为 1。暴击倍率由 crit_damage（倍率本体）与 crit_damage_bonus、crit_bonus（加算子项）相加而成，因此多个爆伤来源彼此相加而非相乘。受害者的暴击伤害减免在区内直接削减增益（倍率−1）那部分；下限 1 保证暴击不会比不暴击更低"
    },
    {
      "scope": "health",
      "id": "base_scale",
      "priority": 0,
      "scale": 1.0,
      "formula": "base_health * health_scale",
      "requires": [
        "base_health",
        "health_scale"
      ],
      "comment": "基础生命值缩放区：base_health 已含装备等加成，再乘以全局缩放系数"
    },
    {
      "scope": "health",
      "id": "bonus",
      "priority": 500,
      "scale": 1.0,
      "formula": "base_health * (1 + health_percent) + health_flat",
      "requires": [
        "base_health",
        "health_percent",
        "health_flat"
      ],
      "comment": "生命值提升区：百分比与固定值"
    },
    {
      "scope": "taken",
      "id": "amplifier",
      "priority": 0,
      "scale": 1.0,
      "formula": "amplifier(damage_amplifier + amplifier_bonus + (has_physical ? physical_amplifier : 0) + (has_magic ? magic_amplifier : 0) - (has_physical ? physical_resistance : 0))",
      "requires": [
        "damage_amplifier",
        "amplifier_bonus",
        "has_physical",
        "physical_amplifier",
        "has_magic",
        "magic_amplifier",
        "physical_resistance"
      ],
      "comment": "增减伤区（加算区）：攻击方的各类增伤与受害方的减伤相加成一个总和，再由 amplifier() 换算。这是增伤与减伤统一的乘区——前 50% 减伤线性生效，超出部分走对数曲线，结果恒大于 0。若一次伤害同时具有多种类型，对应子项会一并计入"
    }
  ],

  "_itemEffectsComment": "物品效果：给武器/装备/饰品追加属性修饰符，在「装备或持有时」生效。字段：target（物品 id，或 #标签）、attribute（本 mod 属性 id）、amount、operation（add_value / add_multiplied_base / add_multiplied_total）、slot（原版槽位：any / none / mainhand / offhand / hand / armor / head / chest / legs / feet）、curioSlot（饰品槽：留空表示按 slot 推导；any 或 * 表示全部饰品槽；none 表示不作用于饰品栏；其余为 Curios 槽位标识如 ring、necklace、belt、charm），comment 为说明。",
  "_itemEffectsSlotRules": "slot 与 curioSlot 是两个独立维度。只写 slot=any 时同时覆盖原版任意槽位与全部饰品槽；只写 slot=mainhand 时不作用于饰品栏。想让某件饰品只在特定槽位生效，用 slot=none 搭配 curioSlot。饰品槽需要装有 Curios，未安装时只按原版槽位生效。",
  "_itemEffectsNotes": "下面几条是默认给出的武器效果，可以随意修改或删除；删空该数组即为「全部武器保持原版强度」。不写 operation 时默认 add_value。武器类建议显式写 slot=mainhand：这样效果会与武器自身的攻击力归到同一组（When in Main Hand）显示；留空则默认 any，会单独多出一组 When equipped，看起来像是两件东西。",
